        "Head bears two pairs of retractile tentacles; upper pair bears dark visual ommatophores (eyes); lower pair is sensory.",
        "Radula tooth ribbon used to scrape vegetative matter; hibernates by secreting a calcified chalky epiphragm over the aperture."
