        "Shell plates surrounded by a smooth, leathery muscular girdle that suctions tightly to irregular rocks.",
        "Underside features a broad, muscular creeping foot flanked on both sides by pallial grooves bearing multiple ctenidial gills.",
        "Radula teeth reinforced with magnetite iron oxide crystals, enabling scraping of tough encrusting coralline algae."
